# Cheesy Cheeseless Scrambled Eggs With Burst Cherry Tomatoes

Based on [Chrissy Teigen Cravings](https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251202235345/https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/252973/cravings-by-chrissy-teigen-with-adeena-sussman/)), pg. 16

{ rating="3" image="cheesy_cheeseless_scrambled_eggs_with_burst_cherry_tomatoes.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Eggs

- [ ] 12 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [heavy cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [pepper]{ ing="pepper" }
- [ ] 3 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 3 Tbsp [butter]{ ing="butter" }

### Tomatoes

- [ ] 2 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 3 cups [cherry tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" } (~1 lb)
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [pepper]{ ing="pepper" }
- [ ] (Optional) 1/4 cup [thinly sliced chives]{ ing="thinly-sliced-chives" }
- [ ] (Optional) [garlic-roasted bacon]{ ing="garlic-roasted-bacon" }

## Recipe

1. Whisk [eggs]{ ing="egg" }, [heavy cream]{ ing="heavy-cream" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, and [pepper]{ ing="pepper" } until combined
1. In large nonstick skillet, heat [oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } and [butter]{ ing="butter" } over LOW heat until butter is melted
1. Start heating a cast iron skillet on medium heat until hot
1. Add eggs and cook, stirring until a custardly and forming small curds. (12-14 min). Remove from heat
1. Make the [tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" } in parallel during the last 10 min of the egg cook time. In the hot skillet, add oil, swirl, then add the tomatoes. Sprinkle with salt and pepper. Cook for 5-6 min until tomatoes shrivel
1. Serve with the optional [chives]{ ing="thinly-sliced-chives" }/[bacon]{ ing="garlic-roasted-bacon" } on top

## Notes

1. For every 4 eggs, 2.5 Tbsp cream, 1 Tbsp butter, 1 Tbsp olive oil
